# Stingblade Assassin: "When this creature enters, destroy target creature an opponent controls that was dealt damage this turn." On
# turn 5 Bot1 Lightning Bolts two of Bot2's three 0/4 creatures (Yoked Ox and Kraken Hatchling live, with 3 damage) and casts Stingblade
# Assassin. The undamaged Tasseled Dromedary is refused as a target; the damaged Ox is chosen and destroyed, while the damaged Hatchling,
# not chosen, lives.

